    "title": "Lewes Legends walking tour | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nLewes Legends walking tour\nLewes Legends walking tour, 4 to 5:30 p.m., begins at LHS, 110 Shipcarpenter St., Lewes. Stories of strange happenings in Lewes, cost is $15 per person, $5 for children ages 8-12. For more information go to historiclewes.org or contact 302-645-7670.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 11/29/2025 - 4:00pm to 5:30pm",
